<p>Iran launched two ballistic missiles toward the joint U.K.-U.S. military base on Diego Garcia in the Indian Ocean on Friday, but neither hit the island, according to British officials and multiple media reports. The Wall Street Journal reported that one missile failed in flight and a U.S. warship intercepted the other with an SM-3 interceptor. The failed strike left the base undamaged and widened an already spreading regional conflict involving Iran, the United States, Israel, and U.K. assets.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/YUA-CqMfP95HMSRiCzdAIGSvhmbKpx-iYAe0BQMR-U6DL1mRb_fCzIIZXW2jEuKh_hltrNQr4GYFWgVwzNNsiNXzVvSKayFWqlzgQwcJ2DBLbUfDhfHab4QHYkVjc-G1yY5vyv73tyE7zeMloDzA_Ltj0LAFDcYLrIQV1FGY4YK9VQthLu0y9cNE0Sci9bGAqrH3Y-xR2lHGgedsCov6NDM1xeOxn66uF8kcSQc5Mzp2bNhYFmnCGZxRq5_j9CsCsW36dTZPFtjeY_88' alt='FILE - This image released by the U.S. Navy shows an aerial view of Diego Garcia in the Chagos Island group. (U.S. Navy via AP, File)' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Base footprint: Diego Garcia hosts about 2,500 personnel, most of them American, underscoring why the base is central to U.S. and U.K. operations in the region.</li><li>UK posture: London said U.S. access to RAF Fairford and Diego Garcia is limited to &quot;specific and limited&quot; defensive operations against missile sites and capabilities that threaten shipping in the Strait of Hormuz.</li></ul><blockquote>Iran’s reckless attacks, lashing out across the region and holding hostage the Strait of Hormuz, are a threat to British interests and British allies - U.K. defense ministry spokesperson</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>United Kingdom: British officials said RAF jets and other military assets were still defending U.K. personnel in the region after the attempted strike on Diego Garcia. (<a href='https://www.politico.eu/article/uk-confirms-iran-unsuccessfully-targeted-diego-garcia-military-base/'>Politico Europe</a>)</li><li>Iran: A senior Iranian official denied that Tehran had targeted the joint U.S.-U.K. base on Diego Garcia, according to Al Jazeera as cited by RT. (<a href='https://www.rt.com/news/635779-iran-denies-targeting-us-uk/'>RT</a>)</li><li>United States: Washington has described Diego Garcia as &quot;an all but indispensable platform&quot; for operations across the Middle East, South Asia, and East Africa, underscoring the base&#x27;s operational importance. (<a href='https://www.rt.com/news/635779-iran-denies-targeting-us-uk/'>RT</a>)</li><li>United Kingdom government: British officials stressed that the U.K. would not take part in offensive operations, drawing a clear line between defensive support and direct involvement in strikes. (<a href='https://www.rt.com/news/635779-iran-denies-targeting-us-uk/'>RT</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-diego-garcia-iran-explainer/'>What to know about Diego Garcia after Iran targets island’s U.K.-U.S. base</a> - theglobeandmail.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/3/21/uk-says-iran-missile-attack-on-diego-garcia-failed'>UK says Iran missile attack on Diego Garcia failed</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/iran-fired-missiles-at-joint-us-uk-base-in-indian-ocean-report/article70768326.ece'>Iran fired missiles at joint U.S.-U.K. base in Indian Ocean: report</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.rt.com/news/635779-iran-denies-targeting-us-uk/'>Iran denies targeting US-UK base in Indian Ocean – Al Jazeera</a> - rt.com</li><li><a href='https://www.politico.eu/article/uk-confirms-iran-unsuccessfully-targeted-diego-garcia-military-base/'>UK confirms Iran unsuccessfully targeted Diego Garcia base</a> - politico.eu</li><li><a href='https://www.wsj.com/livecoverage/iran-us-israel-war-updates-2026/card/iran-targeted-diego-garcia-base-with-ballistic-missiles-rb7MdZW1CfwRTauDYHOt'>Iran fires two intermediate-range ballistic missiles at the Diego Garcia military b